id: pm-rl-local-gate-timing
title: Stabilize local process and card acceptance timings at unchanged bounds
description: "Investigate repeatable local acceptance latency without changing authored limits or coverage scope. In the PR 145 review run, test/process-cli.test.ts reproduced spawnSync ETIMEDOUT alone under its existing command limit, and the canonical 512-case card property in test/policy-card.test.ts reproduced its existing 600000 ms timeout alone. Runs used Node 24, nice, one named test at a time, a fresh home directory and no global/system Git configuration. The same exact fix head 55013729c1e27371e6bd505939b60db151023e19 passed full npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 release gates: 31 policy plus 1489 suite tests per gate, 62 sources, all four coverage dimensions 100 percent. CI evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/41986077627 . The packed LM timing case is already owned by pm-rl-7c7m and is not duplicated here. The HTTP drill and callback matrix passed alone. Preserve every existing test, CLI deadline and coverage threshold while investigating runner/runtime/IO differences. Review refusal fixes remain tracked by pm-rl-proposer-program."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 3
tags[3]: acceptance,follow-up,timing
created_at: "2026-11-05T09:52:10.732Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-05T16:16:02.997Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-rl-apvf
comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-05T10:11:24.980Z",codex-agent,"Final standalone results are recorded in docs/proposer-revert-evidence.json: packed process CLI reproduces ETIMEDOUT at its unchanged 20000 ms command limit; the canonical 512-card property and recoverable card transaction matrix each reproduce their unchanged 600000 ms parent limit. The transaction retry reports 133 tests: 124 pass, 7 failed-to-start after the parent finished, 2 cancellations, zero skip/todo. The packed LM command also reproduces ETIMEDOUT at 25000 ms and remains owned by pm-rl-7c7m. HTTP retry passed 1/1; callback log recovered 123/123 passes with recorder exit status unavailable after the provider interruption. Linked the already-executed process/card reproduction commands without rerunning them. Complete source-fix CI remains green across npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 at original scope and thresholds."
  "2026-11-05T12:32:36.997Z",codex-agent,"PR 145 replay review round 3 adds another unchanged-bound local timing receipt: Node 26 npm release passed 31/31 release-policy tests, then test/baseline.test.ts case refused vector retries converge at every collect train evaluate refusal and terminal boundary on one plain tracker reached its existing 600000 ms parent timeout. The full local command subsequently exhausted a 20-minute outer execution budget and has no completed coverage totals. No successful retry is claimed: the exact fix-head CI release matrix remains queued at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/42025105305 . The new replay-focused run passed 19/19 and restored behavioral revert controls passed 6/6. Preserve all existing test and coverage bounds; replay correctness remains tracked by pm-rl-proposer-program."
  "2026-11-05T13:53:54.713Z",codex-agent,"Round 4 measures the unchanged 500-sequence test before/after retaining all SDK checks. Inputs and native-update draws stay in their original deterministic order; eight identity groups share one real tracker and one lease each. Added structural assertions for all 500 visited sequences, 2000 program operations, 500 native replays, 1000 native read-back checks, 20 native mutations and eight sessions. The existing 600-second parent timeout and all release thresholds remain unchanged. Baseline timing is running; direct release gates will use the CI runtime and isolated Git identity."
  "2026-11-05T13:59:19.165Z",codex-agent,"Unmodified baseline measurement completed with the existing 600000 ms test timeout: test duration 600.009992484 seconds, total wall 604.36 seconds, 1 test, 0 pass, 0 fail, 1 cancellation. This is an incomplete baseline, not a passing timing result. The optimized same-runtime measurement is running; no timeout or coverage limit was increased."
  "2026-11-05T14:21:05.531Z",codex-agent,"Serial lease/workspace reuse alone still reached the unchanged 600000 ms parent bound under shared load: 2 focused tests, 1 pass (ordering), 0 fail, 1 model cancellation; total wall 606.34 seconds. Do not claim a runtime improvement from that attempt. Added at most two independent identity groups in flight within the same test process, using Promise.allSettled so every active lease finishes cleanup before propagating an error. Pure input/update generation remains ordered and all 500 native sequences plus assertions are preserved. Measuring this bounded IO overlap now."
  "2026-11-05T14:45:09.145Z",codex-agent,"The protected paired run also reached the 600-second bound (607.061 seconds total, ordering 1 pass, model 1 cancellation). Inspection found the added outer SDK scope supplied cwd, acquiring the SDK activation write gate while mutateLoopItem opens a nested path-only scope using its read gate. This test-only scope choice can block nested controller work and must not be attributed solely to host load. Removed outer cwd (clients already bind their real workspace and tracker), retaining the shared public read scope, and added per-group progress receipts. Measuring the corrected scope now; no production serializer or controller behavior changed."
  "2026-11-05T15:11:04.242Z",codex-agent,"Completed before/after receipt: original model hits 600000 ms timeout (604.36 seconds total wall, zero pass, one cancellation); final model passes at 362.159370373 seconds (364.76 total wall including the ordering control), 2/2 focused tests, no failures/cancellations/skips. All 500 SDK sequences, 2000 program checks, 1000 read assertions, 20 mutations and 445 drift refusals remain; eight small real trackers/controller leases replace repeated controller setup against growing shared tracker state. Limit remains 600000 ms. Receipt: docs/proposer-review-round-4-evidence.json. Existing unrelated local gate timing cases remain open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-11-05T16:01:22.551Z",codex-agent,"Current full npm coverage run has reported two existing acceptance problems outside the round-4 changes: bounded final failure under the owned-child cleanup retry test in test/controller-boundaries.test.ts, whose settlement guard is 8000 ms; and SIGKILL at every HTTP-to-PM receipt boundary in test/decision-recovery.test.ts, cancelled at its unchanged 300000 ms limit. These are observations, not yet classified as host-only flakes. The rest of the suite continues so complete counts and final failure details are retained. Focused isolated retries will follow before any final validation claim; no source or timeout changes were made for these cases."
  "2026-11-05T16:16:00.416Z",codex-agent,"Isolated Node 26 retries pass 4/4, zero failures/cancellations/skips, at unchanged authored limits. Exact command: node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern=\"owned child cleanup retries|SIGKILL at every HTTP-to-PM receipt boundary\" test/controller-boundaries.test.ts test/decision-recovery.test.ts . Persistent cleanup case 2.646955199 seconds, full cleanup parent 4.411131361 seconds; HTTP crash/replay 124.003810052 seconds; total wall 131.165 seconds. Baseline head 6bfd484 also has successful full npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 gates at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/42029003169 . This supports timing sensitivity of these unchanged cases and does not certify the new head. The known-failing local npm run was stopped after 3525.984 seconds for the fresh final-head CI handoff; 31/31 policy tests and static/artifact prechecks passed, but no completed local suite or 100-percent statement claim is made. Bun local gate is now running serially after npm and retries."
